sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant RagController
    participant VectorStore
    participant OllamaEmbeddings as Ollama embedding model
    participant PgVector as PostgreSQL + pgvector

    Client->>RagController: POST /api/rag/ingest {text}
    RagController->>RagController: Create Document(text)
    RagController->>VectorStore: add([Document])
    VectorStore->>OllamaEmbeddings: Generate embedding for text
    OllamaEmbeddings-->>VectorStore: Embedding vector
    VectorStore->>PgVector: Persist document and vector
    PgVector-->>VectorStore: Stored
    VectorStore-->>RagController: Success
    RagController-->>Client: {status: "ingested", id}
